OL,3,GNEWSAResidents use own cars to block
OL,4,A'bully' developer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA developer is in a stand off with
OL,7,Fresidents after being accused of using
OL,8,F"bullying tactics" in a dispute over
OL,9,Faccess to a new housing estate in
OL,10,FWorcestershire.
OL,12,FPeople living next to the planned
OL,13,F30-home development in Drakes Broughton
OL,14,Fhave refused requests by the firm for
OL,15,Fthem to move cars parked at the
OL,16,Fentrance to the site.
OL,18,FResidents said they have lost parking
OL,19,Fspaces and have been given no suitable
OL,20,Falternatives, while the developer said
OL,21,Fit had a legal right to access the
OL,22,Fland.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
