OL,3,GNEWSAResidents use own cars to block
OL,4,A'bully' developer
OL,5,
OL,6,FPippin Walk resident Laured Kalari said
OL,7,Fthe developer's approach was "some of
OL,8,Fthe most odious" he had witnessed. The
OL,9,Fdeveloper, Owl Homes, was contacted by
OL,10,Fthe BBC on several occasions for a
OL,11,Fresponse.
